<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      background-color: #1769d2;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h2>您的源策未来登录链接</h2>

  <p>您好，<%= @user.email_address %></p>

  <p>点击下面的按钮即可登录源策未来：</p>

  <a href="<%= @magic_link_url %>" class="button">立即登录</a>

  <p>或复制以下链接到浏览器：</p>
  <p><%= @magic_link_url %></p>

  <p><strong>注意：</strong>此链接将在 15 分钟后过期。</p>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>如果这不是您本人发起的请求，请忽略此邮件。</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
